                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Recovery is possible if we give people the care they need, my mom is proof of that. \n\nWe just celebrated her 7-year anniversary in recovery after a decades long struggle with opioids. I've seen how hard it is to get coverage for treatment. That's why I introduced the Recovery Act https://t.co/I7HRXGBWAF",
