                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My mom wouldn\u2019t be alive today without finally getting the treatment she needed, but I know she's one of the lucky ones.\n\nFar too many people are left without care because of the stigma associated with addiction and the lack of funding. (3/4) https://t.co/SCdUGNw9Wo",
