                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "When we give people access to the care they need, we give them a chance to live in recovery. My mom is proof of that. The Recovery Act, will expand access to treatment for substance use disorders, & help people who are often left behind enter into recovery.https://t.co/9QMZpRO9yv",
