                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In my fight to save my mom\u2019s life from an opioid addiction, I saw firsthand how broken our system was & the lack of access to care. \n\nThe Recovery Act will expand coverage, remove treatment limitations, & ensure evidence based care to save lives & address the opioid epidemic. https://t.co/Mppk6fdMAE",
