                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On this International Recovery Day, we honor the 21 million Americans living in recovery & recognize their resilience and strength, often made possible by access to evidence-based treatment. https://t.co/APy16IeIlv",
