                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The biggest barrier to treatment is the stigma surrounding addiction. \n\nWe must share the stories of our loved ones to show what\u2019s possible when people get the help they need. For me, that person is my mom.",
