                "retweet_count": 131,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "A 10 year old who was on her way to the doctor for brain cancer treatment was detained in Houston, alongside her 4 siblings, who are also US citizens, and her parents who are undocumented and have no criminal history. \n\nThe entire family was deported to Mexico. This family\u2019s story is heartbreaking and an example of what\u2019s happening across the country with Trump\u2019s atrocious immigration policies.",
