                "text": "The GOP plan to slash Medicaid won\u2019t just cost lives \u2014 it will also cut thousands of jobs in CO.\n\nHospitals will be strained. Pregnant women, Kids, & seniors will go without the treatment they need to survive.\n\nAll to give more tax breaks to billionaires.\nhttps://t.co/qVbEGXuOxc",
