                "retweet_count": 30,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Members of the LGBTQ community aren't asking for special treatment \u2013 they're asking for the basic human right to live with dignity, safety, and equality.\n\nWhile Trump and the GOP work to roll back LGBTQ+ rights and target our transgender youth, I\u2019m proud to join my colleagues in introducing the Equality Act, which will protect LGBTQ+ individuals from discrimination in employment, housing, and all areas of public life.\n\nEvery person should be treated with the respect they deserve, regardless of who they are or who they love.",
