                "text": "This is Athena. She struggled with her mental health and couldn\u2019t afford the care she needed. Medicaid helped her get treatment so she could return to work. Now she helps others do the same.\n\nAthena\u2019s story reminds us all what\u2019s at stake with the Republican budget cuts that will rip health care away from people like Athena.",
