                "text": "This is Sunny from Wheat Ridge. After losing everything in a house fire, she relied on Medicaid and SNAP to support her family. Medicaid made sure her husband got epilepsy treatment and her son received care through Colorado\u2019s autism waiver.\n\nRepublicans are pushing legislation that would rip that support away from moms and families like Sunny\u2019s. I\u2019m fighting to protect Medicaid\u2014because no family should be left behind when they need help the most.",
