                "source": "Statusbrew",
                "text": "Another lie from Trump.\n\nHe never planned to ensure people desperate to start families had medical coverage for IVF treatment, and his handpicked Supreme Court justices have put IVF at risk in numerous states.\n\nSome of my closest friends have relied on IVF to fulfill their dream of having kids. I know how important it is that we reduce the barriers so many face, but like most things, Trump is taking us backwards.",
