                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "We\u2019ve finally seen a reduction in overdose deaths in CO, including a 35% reduction in fentanyl deaths in the last year alone. But Trump\u2019s OBBB is going to decimate the progress we\u2019ve made to ensure that those who want help have access to the treatment they need.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m working on a bill to ensure CO & the 37 other states who followed our lead can continue to use Medicaid to cover substance use disorder treatment. It is a disease that requires medical care.",
