                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Amazing to see the work I did during my time in the CO legislature alongside my colleagues & advocates come to fruition at SolVista Health. It's the only treatment center that provides support for people who are struggling with addiction in this area. It's an example of what's possible when you have elected officials & local leaders working together to address the needs of our community. But all of this is going to unravel because of Trump's Big Ugly Bill. I promise to fight for places of hope like this that bring desperately needed care to the people who need it most.",
