                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "Like so many families, ours has been impacted by the opioid epidemic. My mom struggled with addiction for years. As a state, Colorado has led the nation in making sure people who want treatment are able to get the care they need. But the Republicans' Big Ugly bill is going to decimate the progress we have made. \n\nI cannot fathom the countless lives we will lose unnecessarily. The republicans should be absolutely ashamed of themselves. @DenverChannel",
