                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Some good news worth sharing. My bipartisan bill \u2014the Support for Patients and Communities Act\u2014 was just signed into law. This will invest in critical prevention, treatment, and recovery programs for people struggling with substance use disorders.\n\nColorado has led the way in expanding treatment and reducing fentanyl deaths, and this law helps ensure that progress continues nationwide\u2014 especially under an administration that has dismantled the progress we have made. I'll always fight so every person struggling has access to the medical care they need to recover and rebuild their lives.",
